**Summary:** 9 subtasks, complexity 3/5, parallel-safe.

| Group | Subtasks | Work |
|-------|----------|------|
| A (parallel) | 1, 2, 3 | defaults/mcp.json, mcp.ts actions, ProcessManager flag |
| B (parallel, after A) | 4, 5, 6, 8, 9 | project-store scaffold, orchestrator wiring, McpConfigEditor component, both test files |
| C (after B) | 7 | Settings page integration |

Key sequencing decisions:
- ProcessManager (3) must land before orchestrator (5) because the latter calls the former with new opts.
- defaults/mcp.json (1) must exist before project-store (4) copies it.
- The component (6) and actions (2) must both be ready before the settings page (7) imports them.
- Tests are in group B so they can be written in parallel with the component and orchestrator changes.
